# BackShot2Alpine: seeded layout drift on the Alpine sources, restored by
# bko-holt in tiers 0-2 (the user's suite; auto-memory "BackShot2 /
# BackShot2Alpine", testvm/backshot2/README.md).  Tier 3 is the ThinkPad's
# cases: a manual line, never an entry (docs/design/batch.md §4.4).
# No `set hosts`: the batch takes the host table's default hosts (testvm/hosts.json),
# every one of them, choubox among them since 2026-11-17.

bs2     BackShot2Alpine 200     why="200 new cases a source, tiers 0-2, then the corpus"
manual  tier 3: BackShot2Alpine's ThinkPad cases (docs/design/bs2-all.md), by hand
